        "harm": "damage",
        "exsurgent": false,
        "active": false,
        "remaining": 0,
        "description": "<p>Psi Shield bolsters the async’s mind to psi attack and manipulation. If the async is hit by a psi attack, they receive WIL ÷ 5 (round up) points of armor, reducing the amount of damage inflicted. They also receive a +10 modifier when resisting any other sleights.</p><p><em>Source: Eclipse Phase Core Rulebook, p. 228.</em></p>"
      },
